   "சங்கொடு சக்கரம் ஏந்தும் தடக்கையன்",
   "பங்கயக் கண்ணானைப் பாடி ஏலோர் எம்பாவாய்"
  ],
  "translit": [
   "unggaL puzhaikkaTaith thooTTaththu vaaviyuL",
   "senggazhuniir vaay negizhndhu aambal vaay kuumbina kaaN",
   "senggal poTikkuuRai veNbal thavaththavar",
   "thanggaL thirukkooyil sanggiTuvaan poodhandhaar",
   "enggaLai munnam ezhuppuvaan vaaypeesum",
   "nanggaay ezhundhiraay naaNaadhaay naavuTaiyaay",
   "sanggoTu sakkaram eendhum thaTakkaiyan",
   "panggayak kaNNaanaip paaTi eeloor embaavaay"
  ],
  "meaning": "In your backyard pond the red lilies have opened and the water-lilies have closed; the ascetics are heading to the temple to blow the conch. You promised to wake us first — rise, shameless eloquent girl, and sing of Him who bears conch and discus in His great hands, the lotus-eyed one."
 },
 {
  "n": 15,
  "title": "எல்லே இளங்கிளியே",
