   "valliirkaL niinggaLee naaneedhaan aayiTuga",
   "ollai nii poodhaay unakkenna veeRuTaiyai",
   "ellaarum poondhaaroo poondhaar poondhu eNNikkoL",
   "vallaanaik konRaanai maaRRaarai maaRRazhikka vallaanai",
   "maayanaip paaTi eeloor embaavaay"
  ],
  "meaning": "“Are you still asleep, young parrot?” “Don't call me that, friends — I'm coming!” “We know your old boasts. Come quickly — have all come? They have come; count them yourself. Sing of the Enchanter who killed the strong and destroys His foes.”"
 },
 {
  "n": 16,
  "title": "நாயகனாய் நின்ற",
  "titleEn": "Open the Temple Door",
