   "aayar siRumiyaroomukku aRaibaRai",
   "maayan maNivaNNan nennalee vaayneerndhaan",
   "thuuyoomaay vandhoom thuyil ezhap paaTuvaan",
   "vaayaal munnam munnam maaRRaadhee ammaa nii",
   "neeya nilaikkadhavam niikki eeloor embaavaay"
  ],
  "meaning": "O guard of Nandagopa's temple with its festooned gates, open the jeweled door! The dark-gem-hued Enchanter promised us the drum yesterday; we have come pure to sing Him awake. Don't turn us away with words — open the firmly shut door, good mother."
 },
 {
  "n": 17,
  "title": "அம்பரமே தண்ணீரே",
  "titleEn": "Wake, Nandagopa",
  "raga": "Kalyani",
  "tamil": [
