   "வந்து திறவாய் மகிழ்ந்து ஏலோர் எம்பாவாய்"
  ],
  "translit": [
   "undhu madhagaLiRRan ooTaadha thooLvaliyan",
   "nandhagooban marumagaLee nappinnaay",
   "kandham kamazhum kuzhalii kaTaidhiRavaay",
   "vandhu enggum koozhi azhaiththana kaaN maadhavip",
   "pandhalmeel palkaal kuyilinanggaL kuuvina kaaN",
   "pandhaar viralii un maiththunan peerpaaTach",
   "sendhaamaraik kaiyaal siiraar vaLaiyolippa",
   "vandhu thiRavaay magizhndhu eeloor embaavaay"
